[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24247.43, "timestamp": "06:44:07", "text": "啊，真漂亮。它既優雅又可愛。我一直想來，這是我的夢想，就像你看，我得到了一個這樣的機會，然後就發生了這樣的事。事情的發展並沒有按照我想要的方式"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 24256.758, "timestamp": "06:44:16", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i just pray we dont hear any stupid stuff after 2.0 comes out. none of the geography moments anymore"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24258.468, "timestamp": "06:44:18", "text": "或我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24262.35, "timestamp": "06:44:22", "text": "預想的方式進行。但即便經歷了這麼多困難，我也希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24271.19, "timestamp": "06:44:31", "text": "這個模型能代表這些年來我所經歷的困難和努力。所以，是的，這也是為什麼我不想失敗的原因。如果我推出新款車型，其他人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24274.31, "timestamp": "06:44:34", "text": "看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24277.19, "timestamp": "06:44:37", "text": "後會抱持著很高的期望，如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24281.51, "timestamp": "06:44:41", "text": "無法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24286.03, "timestamp": "06:44:46", "text": "滿足"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24289.75, "timestamp": "06:44:49", "text": "這些期望，那就意味著失敗。  嗯？如果這個模式失敗了，如果一切都失敗了，即使已經出道，如果一切都失敗了，那我作為一個創作者就"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 24294.07, "timestamp": "06:44:54", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "is debuting the ultimate goal?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24299.59, "timestamp": "06:44:59", "text": "失敗了。不，我"}]